    h2 About Paul Brzeski
    p Paul Brzeski is the Co-Founder and Technical Director of Open Studios, and a writer and creative technologist with more than two decades of experience working with software, the web, systems and graphical applications.
    p His work spans web development, technical architecture, WordPress and PHP systems, DevOps, interactive 3D and experimental R&D. He writes about technology, software, creative practice and the systems people build and live within.
    p Outside of work, Paul is a house husband, writer and dog dad to three fur babies.
